	)
	(text "I2C requires pull-ups. Technically you could use pull-ups \nin the MCU, but using discrete pull-ups means less problems\nat reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 703.326 550.672 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c6a6e871-776f-4910-a5d4-3b1df14e6bc5")
	)
	(text "The value for the DC-de-biasing capacitor (C23 and C24) \nshould be determined by experimentation but 68 pF is \nprobably a reasonable starting point. \n\nAs such, it is a good idea to use a hand-solderable package\nfor this component, and if possible, to place it somewhere\nwhere you can easily desolder it and solder a new cap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 1049.782 316.992 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d53507ad-eb08-48b4-a95c-d3b67ce7664a")
	)
	(text "PWM3B"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 98.806 147.32 90)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d640be7b-264c-4a13-ab3a-f2ff00afd044")
	)
	(text "Using an SD card is of course optional. This\nparticular design is further complicated by\nusing a 4-bit SDIO bus instead of the 1-bit\nSPI option."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 511.556 39.878 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "dc70ca18-d8b4-481d-afa3-bd0812a73dd7")
	)
	(text "TACHO OUT has to be a PWM B pin, if you want to use \nthe PWM to measure frequency. If so, the A pin should \nnot be used for PWM. GP33 is a B pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 117.602 156.464 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "de08a818-6546-4323-a600-0151a2a88440")
	)
	(text "These are both configured for a two-wire PT1000 measurement.\nTo change to three-wire or four-wire, you can cut/solder jumpers\naccording to SBAA275A. The filter resistors and capacitors should\nalso be changed.\n\nSimilarly, to change to PT100, you can change filter resistors and \ncapacitors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 1061.72 749.554 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e61f281b-ee5c-4a7d-a82c-12e30da21cc6")
	)
	(text "PWM0B"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.634 25.908 90)
		(effects
